ster County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/foster-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Foster County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those years, and June to July in 27. So far in 2026, March to April and April to May each came in at 65% of normal on the middle. Grid 33123 had its driest year in 1988, at 51% of normal.</p>"}
